OL,3,GNEWSADrivers told 'take responsibility'
OL,4,Aas deaths rise
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While we keep charging around,
OL,7,Fexceeding speed limits, being
OL,8,Fdistracted by what's going on in our
OL,9,Fvehicles, not paying attention and
OL,10,Ftaking unnecessary risks and chances,
OL,11,Funfortunately we will continue to see
OL,12,Fthese serious and fatal collisions."
